  "description": "*“Why are you doing such bad things to Dad...?”*  \n*“This is wrong. You can’t do this!”*\n\nDeeply scarred by a previous failed marriage, Seo Wooyoung was determined to protect the family he built with Min Taeyong at all costs. But the joy of finally being accepted as a father by Taeyong’s son, Min Sanha, is cut short. Following his husband's sudden death, Sanha begins to reveal not only his long-harbored lust for Wooyoung, but also the shocking truth behind “that night”...\n\n*“Because I love you, Dad.”*  \n*“Can I be Dad’s husband now?”*\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nVolumes: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1007089870), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000116721)  \nChapters: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/nabbeun), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000116929)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/_nabbeun)",
